      "math_academy_id": "q-79337",
      "sequence_position": 1,
      "problem": "Let $S$ be a $9\\times 12$ matrix that has $7$ pivot columns. What is the dimension of the null space of $S?$",
      "worked_solution": "We know that $\\text{dim(Null}(S))$ is the number of non-pivot columns in $S.$ \n\nSince $S$ has $12$ columns and $7$ of them are pivots, then the number of non-pivot columns in $S$ is \n\n$$\n12-7=5.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{dim(Null}(S))=5.$",
